.IX Title "GETWORDFREQ 1"
.TH GETWORDFREQ 1 2024-07-13 "perl v5.38.2" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
getwordfreq \- print word freq information from language model
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBgetwordfreq\fR [\fIoption\fR]... \fB\-m\fR \fIslm-file\fR \fB\-l\fR \fIlexicon\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBgetwordfreq\fR prints out the word string and its freq of all words in a language model.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP "\fB\-s\fR \fIcorpus-size\fR Specify the training corpus's size. The default \fIcorpus-size\fR is 300000000 if not given." 4
.IX Item "-s corpus-size Specify the training corpus's size. The default corpus-size is 300000000 if not given."
.PD 0
.IP \fB\-v\fR 4
.IX Item "-v"
.PD
Be verbose, output other information after word and freq for each line.
.IP \fB\-e\fR 4
.IX Item "-e"
Give format for ervin.
.IP "\fB\-m\fR \fIslm-file\fR" 4
.IX Item "-m slm-file"
Specify language model file.
.IP "\fB\-l\fR \fIlexicon\fR" 4
.IX Item "-l lexicon"
Specify the lexicon file. A default lexicon could be found at \fI/usr/share/sunpinyin\-slm/dict.utf8\fR.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.IX Header "AUTHOR"
Originally written by Phill.Zhang <phill.zhang@sun.com>.
Currently maintained by Kov.Chai <tchaikov@gmail.com>.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBslmthread\fR(1).
